---
import Legal from "../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site";
---

<Legal title="Content Policy" description={`What ${SITE.name} publishes, and how AI tools are used in making it.`}>
  <h2>What is published here</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a personal blog of essays and short scribbles. They are the author's own ideas, thoughts and
    feelings, written in Malayalam, and they reflect the author's views at the time of writing. They are not
    professional, legal, medical or financial advice.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of AI (large language models)</h2>
  <p>In the interest of openness, this is how AI tools are, and are not, used.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Writing.</strong> The essays and scribbles are written by the author. They are not generated by a large
      language model (LLM), and no AI-written text is published as the author's own.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Building the site.</strong> The website's design and code were developed with the help of an AI
      assistant (Claude, a large language model made by Anthropic), working under the author's direction. The
      small drawings on the site (the mood stickers and the 404 picture) are vector artwork written as code with
      the same assistant. The cover pictures are not made by an image-generating AI. The masthead illustration at the
      top of the home page was supplied by the author.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Review.</strong> The author reviews and takes responsibility for everything published here, whether or
      not an AI tool helped with it.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If the way AI is used on this site changes, this section will be updated and the date at the top revised.
  </p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>
    If something published here is wrong, it will be corrected, and a significant correction will be noted on the
    post it applies to.
  </p>

  <h2>Links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to other websites are given for the reader's interest. The author does not control those sites and is not
    responsible for what they publish.
  </p>
</Legal>
